{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40094","label":"GODDESS FALL · Part 2"},"label":"A Mother's Heart: A","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_goddessfall2_01_e","speakers":{"mirror_r":"Mirror","janghwa_n":"Rose","nayuta":"Nayuta","marian_q":"Marian","snowwhite":"Snow White","hongryeon":"Scarlet","rapunzel":"Rapunzel","chime":"Chime","talos":"T.A.L.O.S.","crown":"Crown","kilo":"Kilo","johan":"Johan","cecil":"Cecil"},"icons":{"mirror_r":"si_c982_00_s","janghwa_n":"si_c971_01_s","nayuta":"si_c223_00_s","marian_q":"si_c260_02_s","snowwhite":"si_c220_00_s","hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s","rapunzel":"si_c221_00_s","chime":"si_c331_00_s","talos":"si_c361_00_s","crown":"si_c330_00_s","kilo":"si_c977_00_s","johan":"si_c925_00_s","cecil":"si_c929_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_1","text":"Hmm, this isn't looking good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"land_d","bgArt":"land_d","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_anothermirror","movie":null,"shown":["janghwa_n","mirror_r"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_2","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_3","text":"Marian went and revealed that she's the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_4","text":"And why's that a bad thing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_5","text":"The original plan was for Marian to keep the fact that she's the Queen hidden","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_6","text":"while I subtly leak it to the other side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_7","text":"Then everyone would give her hell,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_8","text":"and once she broke down, I'd swoop in and sweet-talk her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_9","text":"Up to some nasty business, were you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_10","text":"\"Nasty business,\" you say? I prefer the term strategy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_11","text":"Turning someone into a puppet isn't something that happens overnight. You have to take your time with it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_12","text":"Would you like to know how to brainwash someone? I do have a few methods.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_13","text":"I'm not interested.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_14","text":"Well, that was my plan...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_15","text":"but she went and said it first. At that level, it's practically a public announcement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_16","text":"I guess they might try to kill Marian. She's the Queen, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_18","text":"... Thus concludes mine account of Young Lady Marian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BrokenEdenLobby","bgArt":"brokenedenlobby","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nayuta","marian_q","snowwhite","hongryeon","rapunzel"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_19","text":"... Thank you, Nayuta.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_21","text":"Um... Everyone, I—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_22","text":"Nothing's changed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_23","text":"I concur.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_24","text":"I already had some suspicions when she aimed a gun at us back in the Crown Kingdom.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_25","text":"And, after all, our target is that Queen over there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_26","text":"What matters now is what comes next.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_27","text":"Marian, will you have the Raptures destroy humanity?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_28","text":"No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_29","text":"And what guarantee is there that it won't happen?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_30","text":"If that does happen, I want you to kill me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_31","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_33","text":"... Noted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_34","text":"Do the maidens of the Crown Kingdom harbor any objection to this, prithee?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["talos","chime"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_35","text":"T.A.L.O.S.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_36","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_37","text":"T.A.L.O.S. grabs Chime and lifts her up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_38","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_38","text":"Chime locks eyes with Marian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crown","kilo"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_39","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_40","text":"... Chime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_41","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_41","text":"*Smack!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_42","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_42","text":"Chime whacks Marian on the head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_43","text":"Ow!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_44","text":"Queen or no, I care not! Ye're naught but a subject of the Crown Kingdom!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_45","text":"Thou need'st only tell me where thou art and what thou dost in good time!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_46","text":"So...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_47","text":"Act on thy own again without a word,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_48","text":"and I shall give thee a proper thrashing, mark my words!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_49","text":"... Got it. Thanks, Chime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_50","text":"I trust you are in good health?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_51","text":"... Yes, I'm fine now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"crown","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_52","text":"Then, there is no cause for worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_53","text":"I didn't realize you were a person of high status, Marian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian_q","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_54","text":"I... suppose so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_55","text":"Would you consider taking me on as your subordinate? Everyone else already has a position, so it feels a bit lonely being just a commoner.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_56","text":"You have me, Kilo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_57","text":"Ugh, you've been like this a lot lately. It's a bit much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["snowwhite","hongryeon","rapunzel"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_58","text":"They might try to kill Marian...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_59","text":"Hehe, that could never happen. Absolutely not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_60","text":"Those who took care of and protected her would never abandon her. Parents don't turn their backs on their children,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_61","text":"no matter what form the child takes or what hardships they face. They stand by their children... and hold them close.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_62","text":"Even if the child makes mistakes, even if it could cast a shadow over their own future,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_63","text":"parents close their eyes, shut out the world, and stay by their child's side. They never abandon them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_64","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_64","text":"Mirror gazes at the distant crimson clouds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"land_d","bgArt":"land_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["janghwa_n"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_65","text":"It's only natural, wouldn't you agree, Mother?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mirror_r"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"janghwa_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_66","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_67","text":"Still, even if that holds true for the Pioneers and the Crown Kingdom, Eden might see things differently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_68","text":"They don't know Marian well—they have no understanding of what she truly is, or the nature of her being.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_69","text":"To them, she is little more than a Nikke who became a Heretic, and then awakened her Queen Gene.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_70","text":"Nothing more, nothing less.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirror_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_71","text":"A being steeped in peril.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_72","text":"... Done with your tearful reunion?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BrokenEdenLobby","bgArt":"brokenedenlobby","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_edenspear","movie":null,"shown":["nayuta","johan","cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_73","text":"Then get back to your posts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_74","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_75","text":"Nikkes of the Crown Kingdom, follow Cecil.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_76","text":"We'll review your specialties and specs afterward...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_77","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_77","text":"Johan gazes beyond them at the crimson-stained sky.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_78","text":"We'll commence the assault on the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_79","text":"Cecil, any change in her position?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_80","text":"The Queen is currently positioned 10 kilometers from Eden at 3 o'clock. She remains in the air,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_81","text":"but at a low altitude. Isabel should be capable of attacking her at this height.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_82","text":"As observed, she is taking no action, not even deploying Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_83","text":"She's likely performing repairs after sustaining hits from Eden's Spear and Marian Cannon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_84","text":"Or perchance she is afeard, and doth but watch how events unfold.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_85","text":"Your overactive imagination will be your downfall, Monk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_86","text":"'Twas but a thought I voiced.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_87","text":"What's your plan for those clones out there?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_88","text":"For now, I shall leave them thus, for it is not possible to bring them into Eden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_89","text":"Right. I refuse to let any more unknowns inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_90","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_91","text":"Everyone, perform maintenance and remain vigilant until further orders.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_92","text":"... Young Hero and maidens of Inherit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_93","text":"If it so pleaseth thee, I would fain converse with thee for but a moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_01_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_01_s_94","text":"... Very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}